# Words added by hand. They win over cmudict.dict and estimated.dict.
# One word per line: the word (lowercase), then its sounds in ARPAbet, as in cmudict.dict.
# Put a stress number on every vowel: 1 = main stress, 2 = second stress, 0 = none.
# Easiest way: find a word that rhymes in cmudict.dict and copy its ending.
# Then run: npm run build:model
#
# Slang and lyric words: missing from the model, or guessed wrong.
bae B EY1
bruh B R AH1
cringey K R IH1 N JH IY0
finna F IH1 N AH0
fomo F OW1 M OW2
heckin HH EH1 K IH0 N
highkey HH AY1 K IY0
kawaii K AH0 W AY1 IY2
rizz R IH1 Z
shawty SH AO1 T IY0
skrrt S K ER1 T
swag S W AE1 G
tryna T R AY1 N AH0
